3,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Misaki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I feel anxious about the old split. Can we look at actual usage data?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. I need to see the full year to understand the variance.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I worry about who does the math. It takes so long every month.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Rumors are worse than bad math. We need objective numbers to settle this.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,Silence breeds resentment. Let’s find a method that keeps the peace.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Rin, I can help with the calculations if we pick a clear system.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, that helps. I will focus on the historical statements to check trends.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Mio, thank you. I want to see how much time a template saves.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, good. I will check the plug-in monitors to see real-time load.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I will look at the payment log to see where friction already exists.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I also want to see the sunlight data. Heating costs depend on the room.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will also check the electrician's quote. Upfront costs matter for my budget.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will also look at the winter habits. Predictability is key for me.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will also check the last twelve statements. I need the baseline.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will also check the kitchen notice. Small things cause big fights.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,Let’s see what we find. I hope it’s simple enough to not stress me.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will wait for the data. I won’t commit to a plan without seeing the numbers.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I’m ready to look. I just want to stop being the unpaid accountant.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I will analyze the disparity. If it’s small, we keep it simple.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will look for signs of tension. We need to protect our friendship.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
