33,2,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Misaki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Mio,,The sunlight data is scary. Two rooms are cold traps. We need to account for that.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The statements show wild swings. February is triple August. I cannot predict my share.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,The template took hours. I don't want to do that. I need a simpler way.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The monitors show one room uses four times more. The old split is mathematically wrong.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The payment log shows late payments after disputes. The cooler notice shows people avoiding conflict.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, if one room uses so much, should they pay more? It feels unfair to me.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, yes, but the electrician quote is 34,000 yen per room. That is a huge upfront cost.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, I can't afford that. I need a system that doesn't require new hardware.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the monitors are cheap. The real cost is the argument. Let's price the argument.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shunichi, the argument is the real cost. The cooler notice proves people will suffer to avoid it.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,I hate the idea of paying for cold. I want to know my share before I turn the heat on.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I need to know the worst case. If I pay 30,000 in winter, I am broke. I need a cap.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"The winter habits show people just leave things on. If we don't measure, we will waste.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The disparity is real. A flat split subsidizes the heavy users. That is the problem.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"The tension is real. If the bill is a surprise, we fight. If it is predictable, we breathe.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I want a system where I don't have to do mental math in the dark.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I will not sign anything with a 34,000 yen entry fee. I need a low-cost, high-visibility option.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,I will not be the one chasing invoices. I need a system that runs itself.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,The data is clear. We need to move away from the old three-person split.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Misaki,,We need to choose the option that makes the next bill a non-event.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
